部署 VMware ESXi 数据擦除器","2026-11-15",18,"CISA 将 Check Point 与 UnrealIRCd 漏洞 CVE-2026-123039、CVE-2026-114713 加入 KEV 目录","2026-11-16",19,"FBI 警告 ARTEX AI 渗透测试框架被用于全球多行业攻击","2026-11-17",20,"Rapid7发现CVE-2026-90436已被用于攻击Atlassian Confluence Data Center和N-able N-central","2026-11-18",21,"OpenJDK Java4Shell 漏洞 CVE-2026-114938 可导致 RCE，Oracle 已发布补丁","2026-11-19",22,"OpenJDK 披露 Base64 解码远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-114938",23,"VMware vCenter 认证绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-123890 已被 ARMORY CASTLE 利用","kind","daily","安全日报 · 2026-11-12","generatedAt","2026-11-12T00:00:18.351Z","lead",{"_48":82,"_334":308},"leadItemId","ihb325l23pcss0skikvuxyfi2","overview","highlights",[331,332,333],"sections",[237,238,239,240],"flashes",[140,141,142,143,144,145,146,147,148],"cover",{"_133":134,"_135":136,"_137":-5,"_138":-5,"_139":-5},"metrics",{"_129":72,"_130":66,"_131":41,"_132":41},"readingMinutes","prev","next","totalEvents","sourcesCount","modelsReleased","firstPartyEvents","url","/dailyinfo/media/fa1b09fa180d1248.jpg","srcSet","/dailyinfo/media/90d3b394b87e9ea4.jpg 720w, /dailyinfo/media/cd3352c41ce24dd6.jpg 1200w, /dailyinfo/media/fa1b09fa180d1248.jpg 1600w","width","height","caption",{"_149":219,"_48":220,"_152":221,"_154":222,"_156":223,"_158":224,"_160":225,"_162":226,"_164":165,"_166":167,"_168":41,"_227":228,"_169":74},{"_149":211,"_48":212,"_152":213,"_154":214,"_156":215,"_158":216,"_160":217,"_162":218,"_164":165,"_166":167,"_169":68},{"_149":206,"_48":207,"_152":208,"_154":193,"_156":209,"_158":210,"_160":196,"_162":197,"_164":165,"_166":167},{"_149":198,"_48":199,"_152":200,"_154":201,"_156":202,"_158":203,"_160":204,"_162":205,"_164":165,"_166":167},{"_149":190,"_48":191,"_152":192,"_154":193,"_156":194,"_158":195,"_160":196,"_162":197,"_164":165,"_166":167,"_168":43},{"_149":184,"_48":185,"_152":186,"_154":187,"_156":188,"_158":189,"_160":-5,"_164":165,"_166":167},{"_149":176,"_48":177,"_152":178,"_154":179,"_156":180,"_158":181,"_160":182,"_162":183,"_164":165,"_166":167},{"_149":170,"_48":171,"_152":172,"_154":173,"_156":174,"_158":175,"_160":-5,"_164":165,"_166":167},{"_149":150,"_48":151,"_152":153,"_154":155,"_156":157,"_158":159,"_160":161,"_162":163,"_164":165,"_166":167,"_168":41,"_169":65},"itemId","hbjgrefhm6gdjv6nmh92104zs","Barracuda 两漏洞 CVE-2026-116606 与 CVE-2026-111560 已被用于攻击","summary","攻击者已在少量组织中利用 Barracuda 刚修复的 CVE-2026-116606 和 CVE-2026-111560，组合利用可绕过授权控制并取得设备 root 权限。","sourceName","SecurityWeek","sourceUrl","https://www.securityweek.com/recently-patched-barracuda-vulnerabilities-exploited-in-attacks/","publishedAt","2026-11-11T07:53:51.000Z","sourceIconUrl","/dailyinfo/media/6f21a015ea489b81.webp","sourceIconSrcSet","/dailyinfo/media/c2a91b85de7bb9d6.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/6f21a015ea489b81.webp 96w","firstParty",false,"available",true,"otherSources","followUp","v31fconsep72j9z4e4u5rvvw4","CSC Telecom 欧洲电信数据泄露暴露 Swedbank、SEB、airBaltic 等机构客户端信息","CSC Telecom 发生大规模数据泄露，暴露了125 million text messages，受影响对象包括 Swedbank、SEB、应急服务机构、airBaltic 以及数十家零售商。现有材料仅说明泄露内容和规模，未提供泄露原因、暴露数据字段或处置进展。","Cybernews","https://cybernews.com/security/csc-telecom-leaks-swedbank-seb-sms-messages/","2026-11-11T09:00:02.000Z","xo3px77vo84m1faxu5nie5ooc","DarkSword、Coruna 利用广告和失陷网站攻击 iPhone 员工","iVerify 的 2026 年移动威胁报告称，攻击者利用泄露的 DarkSword 和 Coruna exploit kit，通过 Instagram 广告、金融与加密货币仿冒网站感染使用 iPhone 工作的员工。","Help Net Security","https://www.helpnetsecurity.com/2026/11/11/iverify-iphone-exploit-kit-attacks-report/","2026-11-11T05:00:34.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/06c9ab9de6dbb6a5.webp","/dailyinfo/media/9c1b5fa87b3bafc5.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/06c9ab9de6dbb6a5.webp 96w","r2546h3tkbdqveqaoamsqyjys","Microsoft FORGE Lab 复盘 AI 扫描发现 59 个 Linux 内核漏洞","Microsoft FORGE Lab 使用代号 MDASH 的 AI 扫描系统研究 Linux 内核，3 个月产出 59 个公开上游报告和 33 个已分配 CVE，其中 8 个 CVE 已验证本地提权利用，38 个报告的修复已合并主线。","Microsoft Security Blog","https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/blog/2026/11/11/lessons-from-59-linux-kernel-bug-reports/","2026-11-11T16:55:00.000Z","c25h2bq5i1snfg7uby15x9ud5","Microsoft 研究证明 AI Agent 可通过编辑少于 10 个神经元植入后门","Microsoft 研究人员提出 Lazarus，可在无需重新训练模型的情况下，通过编辑少于 10 个很少激活的神经元植入隐藏后门；攻击者需能修改模型权重，触发词出现时，模型会输出并供 Agent 执行攻击者命令。","The Hacker News","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/microsoft-researchers-show-ai-agents.html","2026-11-11T07:21:05.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg","/dailyinfo/media/a1e7de8b6809b50e.jpg 48w, /dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg 96w","iwwjul6qnyiu2hvmqtlcddzue","Unit 42 披露 ARTEX 针对全球零售与咨询云环境的多起入侵活动","Unit 42 已观察攻击者利用 ARTEX 和 CyberStrikeAI 自主执行入侵，ARTEX 被用于攻击多个目标及零售、咨询等行业的客户云环境。截至 2026 年 10 月，研究团队发现 609 台互联网暴露主机运行 ARTEX、1,323 台运行 CyberStrikeAI，另有 21 台同时运行两者。","Unit 42","https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/artex-and-ai-powered-red-teaming-tools/","2026-11-11T23:00:53.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/4d373ddb2d54a219.webp","/dailyinfo/media/c5c35eb93d4d2e80.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/4d373ddb2d54a219.webp 96w","fn77p5pyn1ovua4jxfzp2n5v1","攻击者针对 Qlik Sense 服务器投递 PowerShell 反向 Shell，并准备利用 ActiveMQ 与 Veeam 漏洞","Cynet 于 2026 年 10 月在多个欧洲客户环境中发现针对 Qlik Sense 服务器的 PowerShell 反向 Shell 尝试，命令通过 scheduler.exe 执行并连接 45.115.26[.]23:4455，相关操作还为后续攻击作准备。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/hackers-target-qlik-sense-servers-with.html","2026-11-11T14:01:00.000Z","rxh92nsgv8wymaapqss20aa6c","OpenSSH/musl 口令认证绕过漏洞分析与修复版本对比","文章分析 OpenSSH portable 在 musl libc 且未启用 PAM 时的口令认证绕过，解释同一 TCP 连接内先失败一次后，257–1024 字节口令可绕过影子值为 * 的非 root 账户认证。","先知社区","https://xz.aliyun.com/news/93241","2026-11-10T02:16:08.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/976ac253540515ec.webp","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fxz.aliyun.com%2Ffavicon.ico&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=862a26438132b835 48w, /dailyinfo/media/976ac253540515ec.webp 96w","mms1km0rggfxsxggiojfrk76b","N-able 为 N-central 多个漏洞发布 N-central 2026.4 HF2 热修复","N-able 为 N-central 远程监控与管理平台多个漏洞发布 N-central 2026.4 HF2，涉及 CVE-2026-125883、CVE-2026-125878、CVE-2026-125879、CVE-2026-125880、CVE-2026-125881、CVE-2026-125882 和 CVE-2026-91000。","BleepingComputer","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/n-able-releases-security-hotfixes-for-zero-day-vulnerabilities/","2026-11-11T12:32:27.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp","/dailyinfo/media/3a544a742516b0af.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp 96w","related",[229],{"_149":230,"_48":231,"_152":-5,"_154":232,"_156":233,"_158":234,"_160":235,"_162":236,"_164":165,"_166":167},"q5pk9i6wqjatjvkhjx8a5f75o","N-able 修复 N-central 7 个 CVE，33 个 Able2Shell 漏洞 PoC 已公开","Infosecurity Magazine","https://www.infosecurity-magazine.com/news/n-able-n-central-able2shell-0day/","2026-11-11T17:15:00.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/b3cc9cd29f272a5a.webp","/dailyinfo/media/6406d1b57afc7303.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/b3cc9cd29f272a5a.webp 96w",{"_241":311,"_152":-5,"_243":312},{"_241":259,"_152":-5,"_243":260},{"_241":251,"_152":-5,"_243":252},{"_241":242,"_152":-5,"_243":244},"label","AI 安全","items",[245],{"_149":246,"_48":247,"_152":248,"_154":214,"_156":249,"_158":250,"_160":217,"_162":218,"_164":165,"_166":167},"e1akisn9puw2q428mdfemr4p2","Claude Code、OpenClaw 与 OpenShell 路径检查后越界写入及同步投毒分析","Claude Code、OpenClaw 与 OpenShell 的文件操作均存在检查对象与实际读写对象不一致的问题。Claude Code 的 CVE-2026-103435 影响 < 2.1.129，并在 2.1.129 修复；OpenClaw v2026.2.26 可在拒绝前通过 O_TRUNC 截断或 O_CREAT 创建越界文件，v2026.3.1 将破坏性操作延后。","https://xz.aliyun.com/news/93227","2026-11-09T12:30:29.000Z","研究与披露",[253],{"_149":254,"_48":255,"_152":256,"_154":193,"_156":257,"_158":258,"_160":196,"_162":197,"_164":165,"_166":167},"dtwa818ng8oa0lmiwfqo5kf3w","Grok Build 生成应用暴露风险分析：35,578 个应用无需登录即可访问","安全公司 Claroc 发现 37,571 个由 Grok Build 生成并发布的应用中，35,578 个无需登录即可访问，约 1/10 包含内部业务或个人数据。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/over-35000-grok-built-apps-exposed.html","2026-11-11T12:19:40.000Z","攻击与威胁",[261,262,263,264,265,266,267,268],{"_149":114,"_48":82,"_152":308,"_154":222,"_156":309,"_158":310,"_160":225,"_162":226,"_164":165,"_166":167},{"_149":300,"_48":301,"_152":302,"_154":303,"_156":304,"_158":305,"_160":306,"_162":307,"_164":165,"_166":167},{"_149":295,"_48":296,"_152":297,"_154":155,"_156":298,"_158":299,"_160":161,"_162":163,"_164":165,"_166":167},{"_149":290,"_48":291,"_152":292,"_154":187,"_156":293,"_158":294,"_160":-5,"_164":165,"_166":167},{"_149":285,"_48":286,"_152":287,"_154":222,"_156":288,"_158":289,"_160":225,"_162":226,"_164":165,"_166":167,"_168":41},{"_149":280,"_48":281,"_152":282,"_154":193,"_156":283,"_158":284,"_160":196,"_162":197,"_164":165,"_166":167},{"_149":274,"_48":275,"_152":276,"_154":277,"_156":278,"_158":279,"_160":-5,"_164":165,"_166":167},{"_149":269,"_48":270,"_152":271,"_154":201,"_156":272,"_158":273,"_160":204,"_162":205,"_164":165,"_166":167},"yc1sadq0avsw7w3h0asnbm6v0","Unit 42 披露 Falcon 浏览器 C2 框架攻击 5 国政府机构","Unit 42 发现攻击者利用 Falcon 浏览器 C2 框架入侵至少 5 个国家政府机构的 webmail、政府应用与内部系统，窃取密码、邮件、会话 cookie、通讯和内部文档。","https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/falcon-c2-browser-compromise/","2026-11-11T15:00:23.000Z","qc1r9iuw591mbmk8pfatc2xbl","十余家 AI 开发者平台遭同一类攻击，Chainstack 与 WorkOS 披露凭据泄露","9 月底至 11 月初，至少十几家 AI 开发者平台遭攻击，攻击者绕过核心业务系统与第三方组件，窃取 AI 访问令牌、数据库凭据及客户信息。","安全客","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5ODA0NDE2MA==&mid=2649790708&idx=1&sn=7da1b66daf2243c89e4ca903b90e4a25","2026-11-10T08:52:00.000Z","hpoyhcyj8jyqis5mhai6eg4rx","eMudhra 因密钥处理缺陷撤销 8 个额外 CA，涉及 195 张证书","eMudhra 因内部 Python 脚本缺陷及密钥处理不合规，撤销此前称未受影响的 8 个中间 CA，其中 6 个签发 TLS 证书、2 个签发代码签名证书，涉及 195 张证书及 29 个自有域名证书。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/emudhra-revokes-8-more-cas-it.html","2026-11-11T12:00:53.000Z","w59rywovcc1gwb1eoreru2xl3","攻击者利用 AntiFox AI Agent 窃取 AWS 凭据并入侵 Web 服务","攻击者在 Alibaba Cloud 上托管自建 AntiFox 实例，利用有效 IAM 用户和 EC2 角色针对 AWS 环境及互联网暴露的 Web 服务实施漏洞利用、Webshell 部署、凭据验证、配置发现与 AWS secret 收集。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/hackers-use-antifox-ai-agents-in-aws-credential-theft-attacks/","2026-11-11T15:12:59.000Z","k1s00o45axh6n2j0laqjuuly7","Microsoft 披露攻击者利用 GSocket 在 Linux 服务器维持隐蔽 C2","Microsoft 观察到多个攻击活动将开源远程访问工具 GSocket 部署到遭入侵的 Linux 服务器，在初始 RCE 漏洞修复后仍通过 Global Socket Relay Network 维持访问。","https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/blog/2026/11/11/global-socket-how-threat-actors-weaponizing-gsocket-stealthy-c2/","2026-11-11T19:49:57.000Z","z6sqacicgu5g5kxg4eavs0p1z","攻击者利用 Openwave CVE-2026-111793 与 Cisco BroadWorks CVE-2026-20320","攻击者已利用 Openwave Webtop Media Transcoder 的 CVE-2026-111793 和 Cisco BroadWorks 的 CVE-2026-20320 窃取敏感信息。","https://www.securityweek.com/threat-actors-exploit-openwave-cisco-broadworks-vulnerabilities/","2026-11-11T09:01:07.000Z","k9g0gy54e8kqkx59naz5nvc5r","朝鲜黑客组织被指窃取 64.3 亿美元并用 meme 币洗钱","朝鲜黑客组织 TraderTraitor 被指于 2026 年 10 月 29 日从币*在 11 条区块链上的钱包抽走约 64.3 亿美元，其后通过拆分、跨链、资产互换、借贷金库、coinjoin 和 Privacy Cash 洗钱。","安全内参","https://www.secrss.com/articles/95551","2026-11-10T16:44:39.507Z","/dailyinfo/media/77459fcbf8f21e71.webp","/dailyinfo/media/3399ea7b18d18a6a.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/77459fcbf8f21e71.webp 96w","ConnectWise 正在调查一场针对托管服务提供商（MSP）的活跃恶意软件活动，攻击者利用遭入侵的 ScreenConnect 环境，通过 Run Command 功能向客户设备部署非法远程客户端。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/active-screenconnect-attacks-breach-msps-impact-dozens-of-organizations/","2026-11-11T22:56:21.000Z","漏洞与在野利用",[313,314],{"_149":323,"_48":324,"_152":325,"_154":326,"_156":327,"_158":328,"_160":329,"_162":330,"_164":165,"_166":167},{"_149":315,"_48":316,"_152":317,"_154":318,"_156":319,"_158":320,"_160":321,"_162":322,"_164":167,"_166":167},"xhmvtzol3bn8o41j00otula7s","Microsoft 披露 ASP.NET Core 权限提升漏洞 CVE-2026-114146，CVSS 9.0","Microsoft 披露 ASP.NET Core 权限提升漏洞 CVE-2026-114146，受影响平台覆盖 Windows、Linux、macOS。SignalR 连接未被一致绑定至建立连接时协商的身份，攻击者可注入消息并以受害者身份执行 Hub 调用；该漏洞严重等级为 Critical，CVSS v3.1 评分为 9.0，弱点为 CWE-863。","GitHub 安全公告","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-67wp-ghc2-fw2g","2026-11-11T00:21:56.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/6d6a98e6b62e0bb2.webp","/dailyinfo/media/f426f4f60d806c23.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/6d6a98e6b62e0bb2.webp 96w","w4i7n11q7jgyy4p2xh92mfdcb","Microsoft 11月补丁修复1,090个漏洞，CVE-2026-124194已遭利用","Microsoft 11月补丁共修复约1,090个漏洞，其中CVE-2026-124194已遭利用；该Outlook欺骗漏洞需用户打开特制消息文件，可泄露NTLMv2哈希并用于冒充用户。","Security Affairs","https://securityaffairs.com/202839/hacking/microsoft-november-patch-tuesday-one-exploited-outlook-bug-and-30-wormable-flaws.html","2026-11-11T09:03:48.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp","/dailyinfo/media/2adef5b1e4357a03.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp 96w",{"_149":300,"_48":301,"_152":302,"_154":303,"_156":304,"_158":305,"_160":306,"_162":307,"_164":165,"_166":167},{"_149":295,"_48":296,"_152":297,"_154":155,"_156":298,"_158":299,"_160":161,"_162":163,"_164":165,"_166":167},{"_149":323,"_48":324,"_152":325,"_154":326,"_156":327,"_158":328,"_160":329,"_162":330,"_164":165,"_166":167},"leadParagraph",{"_336":337,"_338":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
